    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/ce35c329f44dadc97cac82b0d556a066.avif?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/175e7c448c8bc522b9b261bf6c3e735c.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with three crewmates in Golden Tides, a pirate-themed adventure MOBA where 20\u201325 minute matches take you across land and sea in intense PvP battles. Choose your hero, lock in your comp, and control the flow of the game. Skirmish on jungle islands, ambush enemies in ancient temples, or sink their ship in a blaze of cannon fire. Whether you're scaling for late or snowballing early, every match demands smart rotations, clean mechanics, and clutch decision-making. You win, or you sink.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.poster.avif?t=1755587201\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.webm?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.mp4?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/666df81860048b1460dcace6ee5cec01.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the deep, skill-based gameplay you\u2019d expect from top-tier MOBAs. Whether you\u2019re setting up the perfect engage or punishing a greedy overextend, every victory comes down to a mix of sharp execution and smart strategy.</p></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/d260463e730ae19676784a237e629a98.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in ability-based ship combat where timing, positioning, and teamwork shape every outcome. Every cannon volley, mortar blast, and harpoon strike is a skillshot, turning sea battles into tactical, high-stakes encounters just as intense as any fight on land.</p></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/21e6066b2660551dd642a850201d3c8d.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a brawler, a strategist, or a coward, Golden Tides lets you choose your path. Farm PvE to power up, or hunt enemy crews for high-risk, high-reward dominance. However you play, every match is different.</p></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/71b72ca86a199ee6296958d57ab05212.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match unfolds in a massive open world with dynamic events, taking the endless replayability of MOBAs to ludicrous levels. And with constant updates, special events, and even more game modes on the horizon, there\u2019s always something new to discover in Golden Tides.</p></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.poster.avif?t=1755587201\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.webm?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.mp4?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/ff9eb098734ca251a94bc68d2b36d84d.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an ever-growing roster of playable pirates, from the sea elf General Almandee-Breeze who commands the tides themselves, to the ruthless Captain Ashar Sharp and the frost-wielding mage Helios, you\u2019re sure to find a hero that fits your playstyle. Whether you prefer brawlers, control mages, ranged casters, or frontline tanks, every pirate brings their own personality, backstory, and unique abilities to the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.poster.avif?t=1755587201\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.webm?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.mp4?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/c3bec1661a8fde8bbb514f3dd518200f.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a strategic mastermind, a fearless brawler, or something in between, <strong>Golden Tides</strong> is designed to be played your way. Pick your fights carefully, or avoid them altogether. Farm PvE mobs to power up at your own pace, or go full aggression and hunt down enemy crews for high-risk, high-reward dominance. Every match offers multiple paths to victory, so play smart, play bold, or play dirty. The sea doesn\u2019t judge, but it does remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/083c7f33da5de04f0bc2c47a7789bcaa.avif?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golden Tides</strong> is built by <strong>Psychedelic Games</strong>, a global crew with deep roots in MOBAs, competitive gaming, and top-tier storytelling. Our team includes veterans behind some of the biggest games in the world, and now we\u2019re channeling that experience into something bold, fresh, and unforgettable.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/ce35c329f44dadc97cac82b0d556a066.avif?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=422 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/175e7c448c8bc522b9b261bf6c3e735c.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=37 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with three crewmates in Golden Tides, a pirate-themed adventure MOBA where 20\u201325 minute matches take you across land and sea in intense PvP battles. Choose your hero, lock in your comp, and control the flow of the game. Skirmish on jungle islands, ambush enemies in ancient temples, or sink their ship in a blaze of cannon fire. Whether you're scaling for late or snowballing early, every match demands smart rotations, clean mechanics, and clutch decision-making. You win, or you sink.<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.poster.avif?t=1755587201\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.webm?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/25be4fd3bc2a2210cd17e7cabad8f5db.mp4?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/666df81860048b1460dcace6ee5cec01.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the deep, skill-based gameplay you\u2019d expect from top-tier MOBAs. Whether you\u2019re setting up the perfect engage or punishing a greedy overextend, every victory comes down to a mix of sharp execution and smart strategy.</p></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/d260463e730ae19676784a237e629a98.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in ability-based ship combat where timing, positioning, and teamwork shape every outcome. Every cannon volley, mortar blast, and harpoon strike is a skillshot, turning sea battles into tactical, high-stakes encounters just as intense as any fight on land.</p></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/21e6066b2660551dd642a850201d3c8d.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a brawler, a strategist, or a coward, Golden Tides lets you choose your path. Farm PvE to power up, or hunt enemy crews for high-risk, high-reward dominance. However you play, every match is different.</p></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/71b72ca86a199ee6296958d57ab05212.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each match unfolds in a massive open world with dynamic events, taking the endless replayability of MOBAs to ludicrous levels. And with constant updates, special events, and even more game modes on the horizon, there\u2019s always something new to discover in Golden Tides.</p></ul></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.poster.avif?t=1755587201\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.webm?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/fbbd09944e6917eb8c71abde45260efc.mp4?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/ff9eb098734ca251a94bc68d2b36d84d.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an ever-growing roster of playable pirates, from the sea elf General Almandee-Breeze who commands the tides themselves, to the ruthless Captain Ashar Sharp and the frost-wielding mage Helios, you\u2019re sure to find a hero that fits your playstyle. Whether you prefer brawlers, control mages, ranged casters, or frontline tanks, every pirate brings their own personality, backstory, and unique abilities to the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.poster.avif?t=1755587201\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.webm?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/0960a260a6103aa4b14d69318e4d26eb.mp4?t=1755587201\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/c3bec1661a8fde8bbb514f3dd518200f.webp?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=30 /></span><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a strategic mastermind, a fearless brawler, or something in between, <strong>Golden Tides</strong> is designed to be played your way. Pick your fights carefully, or avoid them altogether. Farm PvE mobs to power up at your own pace, or go full aggression and hunt down enemy crews for high-risk, high-reward dominance. Every match offers multiple paths to victory, so play smart, play bold, or play dirty. The sea doesn\u2019t judge, but it does remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650580/extras/083c7f33da5de04f0bc2c47a7789bcaa.avif?t=1755587201\" data-has-big width=800 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Golden Tides</strong> is built by <strong>Psychedelic Games</strong>, a global crew with deep roots in MOBAs, competitive gaming, and top-tier storytelling. Our team includes veterans behind some of the biggest games in the world, and now we\u2019re channeling that experience into something bold, fresh, and unforgettable.</p>",
